# Optimization & Polish Plan

## Step 1: Create Shared Constants Module
- Extract WPM, speaking speed, safety margin, token ratios into `services/config.py`
- Remove duplicate constants from statistics.py, speaker.py, planner.py

## Step 2: Extract PDF Generation
- Move all PDF generation from `routes/presentation_rewriter.py` to `services/report/pdf_generator.py`
- Keep route as thin caller

## Step 3: Remove Redundant AI Calls
- Merge StorytellingAnalyzer + HolisticAnalyzer into single pass
- Skip semantic validation AI call (heuristic only, use data already available)
- Merge storytelling analysis into holistic analysis prompt

## Step 4: Fix generated_at Bug
- Set `generated_at: None` → `datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()`

## Step 5: Clean Legacy Compatibility Code
- `services/gemini_service.py` → Keep as delegation shim, remove duplicated logic
- `presentation_rewriter.py` → Keep minimal shim, remove duplicated logic

## Step 6: Improve Logging in rewrite_engine.py
- Add timing, model info, retry count, fallback usage per stage

## Step 7: Add Missing Frontend Panels
- DesignScorePanel, StorytellingPanel, ConsistencyPanel, DuplicatePanel
- AccessibilityPanel, SpeakerPanel, ConfidencePanel
- Show scores, strengths, weaknesses, recommendations

## Step 8: Improve Code Quality
- Remove unused imports/variables
- Fix `_clean_json_response` unused variable
- Add missing type hints/docstrings

## Step 9: Final Verification & PR
- Verify all imports work
- Create PR

